    <item>
      <title>Announcements</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/announcements/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/announcements/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt; ensure that you maintain &lt;strong&gt;current&lt;/strong&gt; Owner name(s), address, telephone number(s), and email(s); along with those same details for your renter, if you have chosen to rent your home. This helps ensure we are able to keep all Owners/residents updated with all issues pertaining to the Association, or their property, and so we may reach Owners/residents in a timely manner in the event of an emergency situation affecting their property, or the neighborhood.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
